Step 5: Pipeline

[1] Pipeline structure
logistic_regression
                        object                 learned_during_fit
step                                                             
features       FeatureEngineer           nothing (row-wise rules)
preprocess   ColumnTransformer  medians, scaling, category levels
model       LogisticRegression                   model parameters

random_forest
                            object                 learned_during_fit
step                                                                 
features           FeatureEngineer           nothing (row-wise rules)
preprocess       ColumnTransformer  medians, scaling, category levels
model       RandomForestClassifier                   model parameters

gradient_boosting
                                    object                 learned_during_fit
step                                                                         
features                   FeatureEngineer           nothing (row-wise rules)
preprocess               ColumnTransformer  medians, scaling, category levels
model       HistGradientBoostingClassifier                   model parameters

Interpretation: Each model is a single object with 3 chained steps.
